OL,3,APaddy Power cuts 1,400 jobs and blames
OL,4,Abetting tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlutter boss Kevin Harrington said the
OL,7,Frise had "fundamentally changed" the
OL,8,Feconomic model of the UK betting and
OL,9,Fgaming industry, arguing it had helped
OL,10,F"fuel the unlicensed, unregulated
OL,11,Fmarket".
